","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxjp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxjp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-13T09:47:16Z","updated_at":"2025-09-13T09:47:16Z","body":"Yes, this seems to be intentional :/\nhttps://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/blob/main/crates/bevy_asset/src/loader.rs#L539\n\nAlso once you have a load context with `should_load_dependencies: false`, there doesn't seem to be a way to configure that.\n\nI don't get what the use case for that is. It would make sense if it were used internally somewhere where dependencies don't matter, but  `load_direct_internal` is never called outside of `NestedLoader<.., Immediate>::load` which itself is never called internally. Maybe this is just an oversight from refactoring.\n\nFYI: Changing the outer asset loader in my repro above to just use `load_context::load` for the inner asset also causes the image to be loaded again.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/3287962543/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"mxjp","id":13220581,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjIwNTgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13220581?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxjp","html_url":"https://github.com/mxjp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxjp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxjp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxjp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxjp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxjp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxjp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxjp/repos","events_url":"https://api